---
import SocialLinks from '@components/site/contact/SocialLinks.astro';
import EmailCopy from '@components/site/contact/EmailCopy.astro';
---

<div class="biography">
  <p>
    I'm Haikhal Roywendra, an Odoo developer in Indonesia and an Information
    Systems graduate with a background in computer and network engineering. My
    studies connected software development with business systems, and my work
    spans ERP customization, web applications, and cloud infrastructure. I'm
    also deepening my DevOps skills.
  </p>
  <p>
    I currently develop and customize Odoo modules at PT Pundi Mas Berjaya to
    support internal business processes. Before that, as a freelance full-stack
    developer, I built web and decentralized
    applications, working across frontend interfaces, backend systems, APIs,
    databases, and blockchain-based features. Before that, I interned as a
    computer technician at Epro Tech, servicing computers and printers and
    helping customers choose computer parts and networking equipment.
  </p>
  <p>
    Outside of code, I game and tinker with homelabbing. I use leftover
    networking gear from an internet café I used to run, keeping that interest
    in computers and networks going beyond my work and development
    projects.
  </p>
</div>

<nav class="about-contact" aria-label="Contact and social profiles">
  <SocialLinks />
  <EmailCopy />
</nav>

<style>
  .about-contact {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .about-contact :global(.social-links) {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-contact :global(.email) {
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .biography > p + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
